1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Bro, what is even happening right now? This makes zero sense.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,200
I swear, this party's vibe is completely dead. We should bounce.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,100
No cap, did you see how he looked at her? Total main character energy.

4
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:11,900
Honestly, that was pure cringe. I can't even look.

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,800
Don't gatekeep the tea! Tell me what happened yesterday.

6
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,600
He tried to flex his new kicks, but honestly, it was an epic fail.

7
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:20,400
Just let him cook, okay? Maybe he actually pulls this off.

8
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,200
Bro is definitely in his villain arc right now.

9
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
I'm not gonna lie, the exam tomorrow has got me stressed out.

10
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:28,800
Chill out yaar, we'll pull an all-nighter and ace it easily.

11
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:31,600
Are you ghosting me again, or did your phone actually die?

12
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:34,400
That plot twist was insane! My mind is totally blown.

13
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:37,200
Bro, trust the process. Everything will fall into place.

14
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:40,000
She literally gave the biggest side eye I have ever witnessed.

15
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:42,800
Say less, I'm booking the tickets right this second.

16
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:45,600
Why are you making such a big deal out of nothing?

17
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:48,400
He really thought he did something there, didn't he?

18
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:51,200
This whole situation is living rent-free in my head.

19
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:54,000
Can we just get some food? I am literally starving.

20
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:56,800
Bro, you need to touch some grass and get off your phone.

21
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,600
I didn't expect that kind of disrespect from him.

22
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:02,400
That beat drop was so fire, the whole room went crazy.

23
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:05,200
You are overthinking again, just take a deep breath.

24
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:08,000
Honestly, this is giving major red flag energy.

25
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,800
We need to lock in right now if we want to finish on time.

26
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:13,600
I was today years old when I learned about this.

27
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:16,400
Bro, you really think they are gonna buy that excuse?

28
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:19,200
She walked in like she owns the whole building.

29
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:22,000
My social battery is completely at zero percent.

30
00:01:22,300 --> 00:01:24,800
That joke did not land at all, absolute crickets.

31
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:27,600
I am not even mad, just deeply disappointed.

32
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:30,400
Did you really stay up until 5 AM watching reels?

33
00:01:30,700 --> 00:01:33,200
Bro, he is down bad for her, anyone can see it.

34
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:36,000
Can you send me the notes? I fell asleep during the lecture.

35
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:38,800
That new coffee place is totally overrated honestly.

36
00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:41,600
I had the weirdest dream ever last night.

37
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:44,400
Bro, stop capping! Everyone knows that never happened.

38
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:47,200
They canceled the show at the last possible minute.

39
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:50,000
My playlist has been carrying me through this entire week.

40
00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:52,800
Are you ready to head out, or do you need another hour?

41
00:01:53,100 --> 00:01:55,600
Bro, that is wild, I never saw that coming.

42
00:01:55,900 --> 00:01:58,400
She really hit him with the 'we need to talk' text.

43
00:01:58,700 --> 00:02:01,200
I am running purely on caffeine and bad decisions today.

44
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:04,000
Why does everyone suddenly have an opinion about this?

45
00:02:04,300 --> 00:02:06,800
Bro, that was a close call, we almost got caught.

46
00:02:07,100 --> 00:02:09,600
I cannot believe we pulled that off without a scratch.

47
00:02:09,900 --> 00:02:12,400
The aesthetics of this place are honestly immaculate.

48
00:02:12,700 --> 00:02:15,200
Don't stress over things that are beyond your control.

49
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:18,000
He tried to act cool, but his voice was trembling.

50
00:02:18,300 --> 00:02:20,800
Bro, we are officially halfway there, keep pushing!

51
00:02:21,100 --> 00:02:23,600
I literally forgot what day of the week it is.

52
00:02:23,900 --> 00:02:26,400
That video has over ten million views in three hours.

53
00:02:26,700 --> 00:02:29,200
Bro, don't leave me hanging like this!

54
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:32,000
I think we made the right decision after all.

55
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:34,800
That outfit is an absolute ten out of ten.

56
00:02:35,100 --> 00:02:37,600
Why do bad things always happen right before payday?

57
00:02:37,900 --> 00:02:40,400
Bro, you are playing with fire right now.

58
00:02:40,700 --> 00:02:43,200
I cannot handle any more drama today, please stop.

59
00:02:43,500 --> 00:02:46,000
Let's just take a quick power nap before the meeting.

60
00:02:46,300 --> 00:02:48,800
Bro, that speech gave me literal goosebumps.

61
00:02:49,100 --> 00:02:51,600
Did you see their reaction when they opened the box?

62
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:54,400
I swear I put my keys right here on this table.

63
00:02:54,700 --> 00:02:57,200
Bro, keep your voice down, everyone can hear you.

64
00:02:57,500 --> 00:03:00,000
This is definitely going into the hall of fame.

65
00:03:00,300 --> 00:03:02,800
I am not asking for a lot, just basic communication.

66
00:03:03,100 --> 00:03:05,600
Bro, the vibes in here are immaculate tonight.

67
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:08,400
She really said that with a straight face, unbelievable.

68
00:03:08,700 --> 00:03:11,200
I need a vacation from my vacation at this point.

69
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:14,000
Bro, you are the GOAT for helping me out with this.

70
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:16,800
I think my brain just short-circuited trying to calculate that.

71
00:03:17,100 --> 00:03:19,600
Why did nobody warn me about this earlier?

72
00:03:19,900 --> 00:03:22,400
Bro, he completely lost the plot during that argument.

73
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:25,200
We should definitely make this a weekly routine.

74
00:03:25,500 --> 00:03:28,000
I have never felt so understood by a single song.

75
00:03:28,300 --> 00:03:30,800
Bro, look outside, the weather is unreal right now.

76
00:03:31,100 --> 00:03:33,600
Did you seriously eat the last slice without asking?

77
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:36,400
I think it is time for a fresh start somewhere new.

78
00:03:36,700 --> 00:03:39,200
Bro, that was smoother than butter, well played.

79
00:03:39,500 --> 00:03:42,000
I can't believe this semester is already coming to an end.

80
00:03:42,300 --> 00:03:44,800
You have got to be kidding me right now, this is hilarious.

81
00:03:45,100 --> 00:03:47,600
Bro, don't let anyone dull your shine today.

82
00:03:47,900 --> 00:03:50,400
I am convinced that time moves slower on Monday mornings.

83
00:03:50,700 --> 00:03:53,200
Can someone please explain the lore behind this meme?

84
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:56,000
Bro, he pulled off the greatest comeback in history.

85
00:03:56,300 --> 00:03:58,800
I am so glad we decided to show up after all.

86
00:03:59,100 --> 00:04:01,600
Never judge a book by its cover, classic lesson.

87
00:04:01,900 --> 00:04:04,400
Bro, you owe me a coffee for that clutch save.

88
00:04:04,700 --> 00:04:07,200
My confidence level just skyrocketed after that compliment.

89
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:10,000
Why do the best ideas always come in the shower?

90
00:04:10,300 --> 00:04:12,800
Bro, this scene gave me full cinematic satisfaction.

91
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:15,600
I am definitely adding this to my favorite moments list.

92
00:04:15,900 --> 00:04:18,400
Can we agree to never speak of this ever again?

93
00:04:18,700 --> 00:04:21,200
Bro, that level of skill is straight up supernatural.

94
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:24,000
I think we officially passed the vibe check.

95
00:04:24,300 --> 00:04:26,800
Stay focused, we are right at the finish line.

96
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:29,600
Bro, this is proof that hard work actually pays off.

97
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:32,400
I am never doubting your instincts again, you were right.

98
00:04:32,700 --> 00:04:35,200
Let us celebrate tonight, we earned this big win!

99
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:38,000
Bro, thank you for sticking by me through thick and thin.

100
00:04:38,300 --> 00:04:41,000
And that, my friends, is how you close a legendary chapter!
